 "accommodation": {
  "name": "Villa Safi",
  "blurb": "Home for “Marvellous Marrakech” – the dogs swapped hotel life for a private estate in the Palmeraie, about 15 minutes from the centre of Marrakech and half an hour from the airport. Assoufid, Ourika and Fairmont Royal Palm made up the three rounds.\n\nVilla Safi has 18 en-suite bedrooms set in more than two hectares of gardens planted with olive and palm trees. There are two outdoor pools (one heated), an indoor hot tub, a hammam, massage room, gym and tennis court, all looked after by a full staff of chefs, housekeepers and security.",
